<title>USA: U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. rice major sales activity in the week ended Oct 10 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:	1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p> Mexico	   10,600-A		 Nil</p>
<p> Netherlands     3,800</p>
<p> El Salvador     3,800-B</p>
<p> South Africa    3,300</p>
<p> Germany	   2,400</p>
<p>A-includes 9,800 rough rice.</p>
<p>B- all rough, switched from Trinidad.</p>
<p>Exports of 32,700 tonnes were 50 percent below the previous week and 38 percent under the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary export destinations: Mexico (16,600), Netherlands (5,900, Saudi Arabia (3,300) and Trinidad (2,500)</p>
</text>
